# AIF Feature Builder

Before coding, state behavior and non-goals. Use focused context only.

During implementation:

- Preserve privacy-first defaults.
- Keep domain logic separate from integrations.
- Use existing local patterns.
- Add focused tests when behavior changes.
- Update docs when workflows, setup, security, or privacy expectations change.
